{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00030","headline":"元日 · 太宗皇帝","name":"元日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高轩暧春色，邃阁媚朝光。\n彤庭飞彩斾，翠幌曜明璫。\n恭己临四极，垂衣驭八荒。\n霜戟列丹陛，丝竹韵长廊。\n穆矣熏风茂，康哉帝道昌。\n继文遵後轨，循古鉴前王。\n草秀故春色，梅艳昔年粧。\n巨川思欲济，终以寄舟航。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}